Package: voicestudio
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Depends: bash, curl, git
Homepage: https://github.com/termux-learn-crypto/VoiceStudio
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: VoiceStudio launcher for Termux
 Installs VoiceStudio from github.com/termux-learn-crypto/VoiceStudio
 (termux branch) on first run, then starts it. Web UI on
 http://127.0.0.1:3900. Commands: voicestudio, voicestudio-update.
